[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_10100100_12_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_10100100_12_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_10100100_12_0010","text":"真乃，怎么了？\n竹轮芝士卷不合口味吗……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_10100100_12_0020","text":"……不、不是啦\n没什么……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_10100100_12_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_10100100_12_0030","text":"……那、那个啊……\n我在想，把这个吃完的话，就要结束了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_10100100_12_0040","text":"灯织做的便当，真的很好吃\n……能一起吃饭，也真的好开心……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_10100100_12_0050","text":"一下子就结束了\n总觉得好舍不得……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_10100100_12_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_10100100_12_0060","text":"……诶\n不就是把午饭的便当吃完吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_10100100_12_0070","text":"……嗯\n是、是啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_10100100_12_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_10100100_12_0080","text":"…………那个\n我还带了点心当甜点……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_10100100_12_0090","text":"野餐还没结束，所以……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_10100100_12_0100","text":"……嗯、嗯\n是啊……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_10100100_12_0101","text":"Motion"}]
